   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The future seen from the past",
     "texto": [
      "**Ha detto: «Verrò domani»** becomes **Ha detto che sarebbe venuto il giorno dopo** (he said he would come the next day).",
      "Here the condizionale passato marks an action later than the past verb; on its own it does not mean that the arrival did not happen."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Questions in indirect speech",
     "texto": [
      "**Mi ha chiesto se avrei potuto accompagnarlo** (he asked me whether I could accompany him).",
      "The word order of the subordinate clause is kept, and the tense is adjusted to the past point of view."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
